\@writefile{toc}{\contentsline {paragraph}{Contextualizing Star-Topology and Knowledge Graph Paradigms.}{5}\protected@file@percent }
\@writefile{toc}{\contentsline {paragraph}{Cross-Source Graph-Augmented Reasoning.}{5}\protected@file@percent }
\@writefile{toc}{\contentsline {section}{\numberline {3}Problem Formulation}{5}\protected@file@percent }
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces End-to-end architecture of OUEG-RAG illustrated with a running HybridQA query. (1)\nobreakspace  {}Multi-source ingestion anchors candidate table rows and expands hyperlinked Wikipedia passages. (2)\nobreakspace  {}Schema-preserving online multigraph construction introduces star-topology record centroids $\rho _i$ to bind cell attributes, bridging tabular entities to external passages via deterministic text triples. (3)\nobreakspace  {}The dual-track engine serializes the complete subgraph via lossless prompt compression while enumerating scored candidate paths as non-filtering reading guides, actively resolving structural score collisions. (4)\nobreakspace  {}The unified prompt payload steers LLM generation to produce the exact grounded answer with an auditable provenance trace.}}{6}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:pipeline}{{2}{6}}
