\newlabel{eq:star-topology}{{2}{7}}
\@writefile{toc}{\contentsline {paragraph}{Text edges and rule-based extraction.}{7}\protected@file@percent }
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Detailed schema-preserving online multigraph construction. (Left) Flattening tables into unstructured strings decouples row attributes and loses column qualifiers. (Right) OUEG-RAG introduces a local centroid record node $\rho _0 \in V_{\text  {rec}}$ with star-topology bindings to preserve intra-row attributes ($E_{\text  {rec}}, E_{\text  {attr}}$). Wikipedia hyperlinks bridge tabular entities directly to external text passages ($E_{\text  {link}}$), from which deterministic rule-based text triples ($E_{\text  {text}}$) are extracted on-the-fly without LLM hallucination.}}{8}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:kg-construction}{{3}{8}}
\@writefile{toc}{\contentsline {paragraph}{Entity normalization and resolution.}{8}\protected@file@percent }
