\newlabel{eq:tiebreak-score}{{5}{9}}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Detailed illustration of OUEG dual-track reasoning, structural ambiguity resolution, and unified prompt payload. (Left) Rather than destructive top-$N$ path filtering, Track\nobreakspace  {}3a compresses the complete evidence subgraph with a shared passage dictionary $\mathcal  {S}_p$, while Track\nobreakspace  {}3b enumerates multi-factor scored candidate paths ($S(p)$) as non-filtering reading guides. Track\nobreakspace  {}3c detects structural candidate score collisions, applying a bridge lexical tiebreak $\tau (c)$ to resolve ties deterministically. (Right) The synthesized compact prompt payload provides the backbone LLM with complete evidence and directed reading focus, producing the grounded answer alongside a full provenance trace.}}{10}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:dual-track}{{4}{10}}
