\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Main benchmark comparison between Direct LLM and OUEG-RAG on HybridQA ($N=1{,}500$) across the open-weights GPT-OSS model family (20B and 120B). Pairwise evaluation yields 105 wins vs.\ 80 losses on 20B (net $+25$, $p=0.078$), and 120 wins vs.\ 80 losses on 120B (net $+40$, McNemar $p = 0.0058 < 0.01$). Higher is better for accuracy; lower is better for empty rate and latency.}}{11}\protected@file@percent }
